    },
    {
      "ordinal": 44,
      "label": "ajito_aku_040_nelke_08",
      "hash64": "141F4EB4A3D0D70C",
      "text": "Merci. J’irai droit au but.[VAR 0x0114(001E)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 27,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001E"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 45,
      "label": "ajito_aku_040_nelke_09",
      "hash64": "141F4FB4A3D0D8BF",
      "text": "Si vous continuez à agir de la sorte, vous allez\\nvous faire renvoyer de l’académie.[VAR 0x0114(001E)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 83,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001E"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 46,
      "label": "ajito_aku_040_nelke_10",
      "hash64": "1422DCB4A3D3FE2D",
      "text": "Alors, pourquoi ne pas mettre un terme à\\nla Team Star et retourner à l’école ?[VAR 0x0114(001E)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 78,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001E"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 47,
      "label": "ajito_aku_040_akuboss_23",
      "hash64": "B7B9762A841D36FC",
      "text": "C’est ça que tu veux savoir ?\\c\\nEh ben, j’vais te le dire : on attend le come-back\\nde quelqu’un d’important. Même si pour l’instant,\\r\\non a pas trop de signes de vie de sa part...[VAR 0x0114(0021)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 29,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 133,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 181,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0021"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 48,
      "label": "ajito_aku_040_nelke_11",
      "hash64": "1422DBB4A3D3FC7A",
      "text": "Quelqu’un d’important ?\\nUn camarade ?[VAR 0x0114(001E)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 37,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001E"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
